        Using the values you filed in on the previous table, what is the shape of the function \( x = R\cos(\omega t) \) for \( t=0\) to \( t=\dfrac{4\pi}{\omega}\), where \( R={@a@}\) and \( \omega={@b@}  \)?
    </span>
